# Local Android TWA (Play Store) project scaffold — generated locally, contains
# the app signing keystore and must never be committed, especially not to a
# public repo. Kept out of version control entirely rather than gitignoring
# just the keystore, since the whole thing is a separate, regeneratable build
# artifact from a different toolchain than this repo.
